{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986467-world-of-darkness-and-wwi","id":986467,"title":"World of Darkness and WWI","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-10-12T16:44:42-07:00","id":986467,"title":"World of Darkness and WWI","content":"So, i been trying to figure out as much info as i can from the WW1. The different factions of supernaturals involved and such<br /> other than The Great War, any other info lying around?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T07:03:19-07:00","id":986738,"title":"","content":"The general philosophy is &quot;Real World Horrors are not the result of WoD Supernaturals&quot;, so while individual Supernaturals may have been involved in one way or another, it's not like the Camarilla was on one side and the Sabbat was on the other.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T07:53:02-07:00","id":987748,"title":"","content":"Well, there's Czar Vargo of course. For particular page references, ask.<br /> <br /> 1914: There's also Gustav Breidenstein using the war and directing German forces (and his own ghoul brigades) to crush Toreador princes in France, the Sabbat and Camarilla brawling over Panama, and a small Anarch revolt in France taking advantage of the chaos. Interestingly, Gustav and the Anarchs are seperate events, but you could easily tie them together into the anarchs surging up while the French toreador try and hold territory.<br /> <br /> 1915: The Virtual Adepts are behind the Zimmerman Telegram being leaked.<br /> <br /> 1916: The Void Engineer Neutralization Specialist Corps is formed because of the spiritual brutality of the war sparking much invasion by banes and wraiths.<br /> <br /> 1917: Spectres burn down a large part of Atlanta, the Arcanum lose their St. Petersburg chapter house in the Revolution, and of course, the Brujah anarchs engineer the Russian revolution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5307-loomer","name":"loomer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5307_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T10:24:28-07:00","id":987817,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986467-world-of-darkness-and-wwi?p=986738#post986738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The general philosophy is &quot;Real World Horrors are not the result of WoD Supernaturals&quot;, so while individual Supernaturals may have been involved in one way or another, it's not like the Camarilla was on one side and the Sabbat was on the other.</div> </div> </div> </div>Except, of course, that they almost always are. See loomer for a very well prepared SHORT list of matters relevant to WWI that belie that oft trotted out chestnut completely and utterly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1062-ajax","name":"Ajax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1062_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T10:50:51-07:00","id":987829,"title":"","content":"While human beings are involved in the individual horrors of war (the vast majority of civilians are murdered and raped by human soldiers in war), there are exceptions. WtA noted that the Roman legions were comprised by fomori soldiers, meaning that the murder and rape of the Roman soldiers were influenced by the banes that had possessed them. In addition, the leaders are often beholden to one or more supernatural factions.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T12:28:14-07:00","id":987887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/986467-world-of-darkness-and-wwi?p=986738#post986738\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The general philosophy is &quot;Real World Horrors are not the result of WoD Supernaturals&quot;, so while individual Supernaturals may have been involved in one way or another, it's not like the Camarilla was on one side and the Sabbat was on the other.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> This is mostly true for WW II, where while there were supernatural influences (Syndicate and Breidenstein supporting Hitler, the Nephandic spreading their tentacles all over the reich, Himmler the Tremere ghoul,the Ventrue support for fascism and the whole Get of Fenris mistake) the main drive behind the horror is human.<br /> <br /> For other events, like WW I , it's always a supernatural conspiracy of some sort.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T15:53:49-07:00","id":987974,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://whitewolf.wikia.com/wiki/Charnel_Houses_of_Europe:_The_Shoah\" target=\"_blank\">Charnel Houses of Europe: The Shoah</a> is a Wraith book on the second World War and its effects on the Shadowlands. It is a Black Dog book though, so keep that in mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12085-beriorn","name":"Beriorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12085_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}